    "Description": "A transparency slide that shows the left hind quarter of a carousel pig. The skin of the pig is a light tan, and in some portions the paint has been removed, leaving a reddish orange color. The saddle is dark brown with a light brown and yellow saddle blanket. The tack is red, yellow, and green. The pig is very well worn. The slide reads “PULLEN PARK CAROUSEL PULLEN PARK 16A LEFT REAR” at the top and “Pig RALEIGH NC WAKE CO 6-79 RR RALEIGH FINE ARTS SOCIETY” at the bottom.",
